      },
      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "盗賊を倒したようだな。よくやったぞ。\n奴らは付近の住人を随分悩ませていたらしい。\n珍しい話ではないが、救える者は救いたい。\n約束の品を持っていけ。これからも精進を怠るなよ。",
        "official_en": "You defeated them. Well done. They won't be\ncausing trouble for the locals anymore. It's just one\nbattle, but anything we can do to help people in\nneed is worthwhile. Here's your reward.",
        "real_en": null
      },
